    <briefdescription>
<para>United Kingdom calendars. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Public holidays (data from <ulink url="http://www.dti.gov.uk/er/bankhol.htm">http://www.dti.gov.uk/er/bankhol.htm</ulink>): <itemizedlist>
<listitem>
<para>Saturdays </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Sundays </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>New Year&apos;s Day, January 1st (possibly moved to Monday) </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Good Friday </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Easter Monday </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Early May Bank Holiday, first Monday of May </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Spring Bank Holiday, last Monday of May </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Summer Bank Holiday, last Monday of August </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Christmas Day, December 25th (possibly moved to Monday or Tuesday) </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Boxing Day, December 26th (possibly moved to Monday or Tuesday) </para></listitem>
</itemizedlist>
</para><para>Holidays for the stock exchange: <itemizedlist>
<listitem>
<para>Saturdays </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Sundays </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>New Year&apos;s Day, January 1st (possibly moved to Monday) </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Good Friday </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Easter Monday </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Early May Bank Holiday, first Monday of May </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Spring Bank Holiday, last Monday of May </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Summer Bank Holiday, last Monday of August </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Christmas Day, December 25th (possibly moved to Monday or Tuesday) </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Boxing Day, December 26th (possibly moved to Monday or Tuesday) </para></listitem>
</itemizedlist>
</para><para>Holidays for the metals exchange: <itemizedlist>
<listitem>
<para>Saturdays </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Sundays </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>New Year&apos;s Day, January 1st (possibly moved to Monday) </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Good Friday </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Easter Monday </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Early May Bank Holiday, first Monday of May </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Spring Bank Holiday, last Monday of May </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Summer Bank Holiday, last Monday of August </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Christmas Day, December 25th (possibly moved to Monday or Tuesday) </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Boxing Day, December 26th (possibly moved to Monday or Tuesday) </para></listitem>
</itemizedlist>
</para><para><xrefsect id="todo_1_todo000068"><xreftitle>Possible enhancements</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>add LIFFE</para></xrefdescription></xrefsect></para><para><xrefsect id="test_1_test000151"><xreftitle>Tests</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>the correctness of the returned results is tested against a list of known holidays. </para></xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>    </detaileddescription>
